*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*% MXW01 48 mm thermal cat printer — used by cupsd when talking to mxw01d.
*% Roll by default. Document A4/Letter exist so LibreOffice can emit a full page.
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.2"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "CATMXW01.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Cat Printer"
*Product: "(MXW01)"
*ModelName: "Cat Printer MXW01"
*ShortNickName: "Cat Printer"
*NickName: "Cat Printer MXW01"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: False
*DefaultColorSpace: Gray
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.0
*cupsModelNumber: 1
*cupsManualCopies: True
*cupsFilter2: "application/pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "application/vnd.cups-pdf application/pdf 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/jpeg image/jpeg 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/png image/png 0 -"
*cupsFilter2: "image/pwg-raster image/pwg-raster 0 -"
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: Roll48
*PageSize Roll48/Cat tape 48mm: "<</PageSize[136 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize Roll48Long/Cat tape long: "<</PageSize[136 1417]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DocA4/Document A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageSize DocLetter/Document Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize
*OpenUI *PageRegion/Page Region: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: Roll48
*PageRegion Roll48/Cat tape 48mm: "<</PageSize[136 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion Roll48Long/Cat tape long: "<</PageSize[136 1417]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DocA4/Document A4: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*PageRegion DocLetter/Document Letter: "<</PageSize[612 792]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion
*DefaultImageableArea: Roll48
*ImageableArea Roll48: "0 0 136 842"
*ImageableArea Roll48Long: "0 0 136 1417"
*ImageableArea DocA4: "0 0 595 842"
*ImageableArea DocLetter: "0 0 612 792"
*DefaultPaperDimension: Roll48
*PaperDimension Roll48: "136 842"
*PaperDimension Roll48Long: "136 1417"
*PaperDimension DocA4: "595 842"
*PaperDimension DocLetter: "612 792"
*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 15 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: Paper
*MediaType Paper/Paper: ""
*MediaType Sticker/Sticker: ""
*CloseUI: *MediaType
*OpenUI *CatQuality/Print style: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *CatQuality
*DefaultCatQuality: Default
*CatQuality Default/Default: ""
*CatQuality Picture/Picture: ""
*CatQuality Text/Text: ""
*CatQuality Document/Document: "<</PageSize[595 842]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *CatQuality
*% Document style needs a full office page; tape sizes clip LibreOffice.
*UIConstraints: *CatQuality Document *PageSize Roll48
*UIConstraints: *CatQuality Document *PageSize Roll48Long
*UIConstraints: *PageSize Roll48 *CatQuality Document
*UIConstraints: *PageSize Roll48Long *CatQuality Document
*OpenUI *CatTone/Tone: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 30 AnySetup *CatTone
*DefaultCatTone: BlackWhite
*CatTone BlackWhite/Black and white: ""
*CatTone Grayscale/Grayscale: ""
*CloseUI: *CatTone
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*DefaultResolution: 203dpi
*Resolution 203dpi/203 DPI: ""
*CloseUI: *Resolution
*HWMargins: 0 0 0 0
*VariablePaperSize: True
*MaxMediaWidth: 136
*MaxMediaHeight: 14400
*ParamCustomPageSize Width: 1 points 72 136
*ParamCustomPageSize Height: 2 points 72 14400
*ParamCustomPageSize WidthOffset: 3 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize HeightOffset: 4 points 0 0
*ParamCustomPageSize Orientation: 5 int 0 0
*CustomPageSize True: "pop pop pop <</PageSize[5 -2 roll]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
